                                                "sense_id": "8ec0841b-5b00-3cae-9dd0-6a7e5feef2e3",
                                                "text": "You know, that being an old bachelor, and somewhat of an epicure, he is at home, what the vulgar call a cot; and has laid down his spontoon for the tasting spoon, converted his sword into a carving knife, and his sash into a jelly bag."
                                            }
